{"explanation":"Drag the four colored handles to change the sine wave directly: A controls its signed amplitude, B controls its frequency, C shifts it horizontally, and D shifts it vertically. The period is 2π/B, so moving the B handle closer to C makes the oscillations faster. Drag A below the midline to flip the wave.","manimCode":"const ax = new Axes({ xRange: [-6, 6, 1], yRange: [-3, 3, 1], xLength: 11, yLength: 4.6, tips: false });
